---
import '../../styles/trust-section.css';
import OutlineIcon from '../shared/OutlineIcon.astro';
---

<section class="trust-section section-pad">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading centered">
      <p class="label muted">Make career stream decisions with absolute certainity</p>
      <h2>How this webinar session helps parents make a calmer, better-informed decision with clarity</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="trust-concern-grid">
      <article>
        <h3>“My child has good marks, but no clear direction.”</h3>
        <p>The webinar explains why marks alone are not enough for stream selection.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>“Everyone is pushing Science or Commerce.”</h3>
        <p>The webinar helps parents separate social pressure from real fit.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>“We do not want to make a wrong decision after Class 10.”</h3>
        <p>The webinar gives parents a structured way to think before choosing.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="trust-proof-shell">
      <div class="trust-proof-list">
        <span><OutlineIcon name="badge-check" size={16} /> Led by an experienced education professional</span>
        <span><OutlineIcon name="school" size={16} /> Focused specifically on Class 8–10 stream decisions</span>
        <span><OutlineIcon name="heart-handshake" size={16} /> Designed for practical Indian parent-child career discussions</span>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-statement-list">
        <article>Built for parent clarity, not fear-based pressure.</article>
        <article>Designed to make stream discussions calmer at home.</article>
        <article>Focused on practical next steps, not vague inspiration.</article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
